# Copy this to .env.local for local work. It is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# On Vercel there is nothing to commit: the same names go in Settings ->
# Environment Variables. A vercel.json is only for things Next cannot say on
# its own (custom headers, rewrites, cron, a pinned region), and this app needs
# none of them.
#
# One gotcha worth knowing: anything named NEXT_PUBLIC_ is read at build time
# and baked into the browser bundle. Changing one of those needs a fresh
# deployment, not just a restart.


# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Supabase
#
# Project Settings -> API.
#
# These two are the whole of what the pre-launch landing page needs. The
# waitlist writes straight to Postgres and nothing else on the public path
# touches a service.
#
# The anon key is meant to be public. It ships to the browser by design, and
# row level security is what actually protects the data: the waitlist grants
# anon an insert and no select, so the list cannot be read back through it.
# The service role key is deliberately absent, because nothing here uses one.
# If you ever add it, do not give it a NEXT_PUBLIC_ name.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key


# --------------------------------------------------------------- the model
#
# Only the course builder calls a model: reading an upload, working out the
# structure, writing the cards. The landing page and the waitlist never do, so
# a waitlist-only deployment can leave this unset. The app routes redirect to
# /setup until it is there.
#
# The plan is Mistral rather than Anthropic while the app is being built and
# tested, because the bill for a lot of throwaway generations matters more at
# this stage than the last few points of quality.
#
# Note that src/server/ai/client.ts still talks to Anthropic. Swapping it is a
# real change, not a rename: a different SDK, and structured output expressed
# as a JSON schema rather than through the Anthropic Zod helper. Until that is
# done, the name below is the one the code reads.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: override the model used for structuring and card writing.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
